# Supabase Schema Audit & Sync

## Overview
Audit local Supabase schema files and compare with deployed state to establish synchronization strategy.

## Tasks

### [ ] Discovery Phase
- [ ] Find all Supabase schema/migration files in the codebase
- [ ] Identify database configuration files
- [ ] Locate any existing migration tools or scripts

### [ ] Audit & Analysis
- [ ] Document what schemas/tables are defined locally
- [ ] Check current Supabase database state
- [ ] Create comparison report (local vs. remote)

### [ ] Synchronization Strategy
- [ ] Establish migration workflow
- [ ] Create deployment scripts if needed
- [ ] Document the sync process

### [ ] Implementation
- [ ] Apply missing migrations to Supabase
- [ ] Verify database state
- [ ] Set up ongoing migration tracking
